{
  "title": "JAMANVAAR | Kiosk Admin",
  "text": "Welcome screen updated\nRoyal Gujarati Traditional Multi Cuisine Restaurant & Caterers\nKIOSK ADMIN\nRoyal Gujarati Traditional Multi Cuisine Restaurant & Caterers\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLOCAL-FIRST\nLogout\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\n\nKIOSK · APPEARANCE\n\nWelcome Screen\n\nCustomize the experience guests see before they start ordering.\n\nReset to Default\nApply to Kiosk\nApply to\nAll kiosks in this branch\nKiosk One · 4b9647bf\nKiosk Two · bba57b11\n\nRoyal Gujarati Traditional Multi Cuisine Restaurant & Caterers\n\nBranch settings stay within this branch. Individual kiosks can use their own design. Switch branch before configuring another location.\n\nWelcome screen published. Waiting for kiosk acknowledgements; offline kiosks receive it when they reconnect.\n\nHotel name & welcome message\n\n1. Enter the hotel or restaurant name. 2. Add a greeting and personal message. These appear immediately in the preview. Leave a field empty to use the restaurant or language default.\n\nHotel / restaurant name\nWelcome greeting\nCustom welcome message\nStart Order button\nTouch instruction\nRestaurant logo URL\n\nUpload your restaurant logo in Appearance & Content. Names and messages are live UI, never printed into a background.\n\nShow freshly prepared note\nShow promotion\nBackground collection\n\n2 available platform designs ? Selection limit: 2. Live text always stays editable.\n\nUpload Custom Background\n\nRecommended: 1080 × 1920 portrait. PNG, JPG or WebP, up to 12 MB. Uploads are optimized before saving. Three custom designs per branch.\n\nRefresh available designs\nDefault\nMidnight Spice\n\nDark & Dramatic\n\nPreview\nDefault\nBotanical Bistro\n\nBotanical & Fresh\n\nPreview\nKiosk Preview\nSaved configuration\nPortrait\nLandscape\n768 × 1024\n800 × 1280\n820 × 1180\n1024 × 768\n1280 × 800\n1366 × 768\n1920 × 1080\n\nWelcome to\n\nRoyal Gujarati Traditional Multi Cuisine Restaurant & Caterers\n\nOur existing design stays active\n\nStart Order\n\nTouch screen to begin your order\n\nSame renderer as the customer kiosk · English preview · 800 × 1280\n\nImage fit & position\nFit\nFill screen · Cover\nShow full photo · Soft backdrop\nHorizontal position · 50\nVertical position · 50\nZoom · 1\nReadability overlay · 0.2\nConfiguration delivery\n\nVersion: 2026-10-07T11:01:42.738Z\n\nPublished configuration\n\nKiosk One: Pending sync / not yet acknowledged\n\nKiosk Two: Pending sync / not yet acknowledged\n\nOnline kiosks receive configuration events. Offline kiosks keep their last saved design and catch up after reconnecting.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
